§ ARCHITECTURE-NOTES-APPLIED
  MLIR-pattern            ← Op owns Region[] ; Region owns Block[] ; Block owns Op[]
  SSA block-args          ← Cranelift-style ; single-owner values ; no phi headaches
  Braun-style SSA-build   ← walk AST ; lazy block-arg insertion ; no dominance-tree
  structured regions      ← Region_Kind enum enforced by verifier
  error-accumulating      ← matches parser/semantic/typecheck diag-list convention
  structural-first verify ← region-shape → term → dominance → types
  deterministic dumps     ← attrs sorted by key ; stable golden-diff output
  curried arrow walk      ← verify_return derives R from sig via n_params hops
  Odin self-test          ← fabricate bad IR in-process ; no source-level hack

