§ OPEN-FROM-SESSION-6
  Q? IR-optimization-pass layering — should const-fold run before or after
     morpheme-aware refinement assertion lowering? (impacts correctness of
     attribute-preserving constant-propagation through OP_MORPH)
  Q? block-arg-for-loop-carried — current lowering uses single-block fn-bodies ;
     loops inside lower_for keep all state in locals. When we add mutation,
     loop-carried values need block-args threading. Schema already supports it.
  Q? ir-text-parser — round-trip IR via text-dump + reparse ? Would give us
     golden-file update workflows, but adds a second IR frontend to maintain.

